{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552","id":4093935878,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Le11-","number":117552,"title":"Fix PointLight2D texture filter not respecting NormalMap setting","user":{"login":"wangshucheng","id":10466053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDY2MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10466053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng","html_url":"https://github.com/wangshucheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-18T09:38:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T12:55:49Z","closed_at":"2026-03-18T12:50:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117552.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Issue\r\nFixes #76266 - PointLight2D doesn't respect Nearest texture filter for normal-maps or shadows\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nWhen using PointLight2D with a CanvasTexture containing a NormalMap, setting the texture filter to Nearest had no effect. The lighting still used Linear interpolation, causing incorrect lighting for pixel-art style games.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nAdded texture_filter support throughout the Light2D rendering pipeline:\r\n- Added texture_filter field to CanvasLight and Light structures\r\n- Implemented canvas_light_set_texture_filter() in RenderingServer\r\n- Added set_texture_filter()/get_texture_filter() API to Light2D\r\n\r\n## Files Changed\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_render_rd.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_render.h\r\n- servers/rendering/rendering_server.h\r\n- servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.h\r\n- servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp\r\n- scene/2d/light_2d.h\r\n- scene/2d/light_2d.cpp\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nTest scene created: test_scenes/test_pointlight_filter.tscn, unit tests can be added if needed\r\nSupports switching filter modes at runtime (1=Nearest, 2=Linear, 3=Default)\r\n\r\n## Backward Compatibility\r\nDefault value is TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE, maintaining existing behavior.","closed_by":{"login":"wangshucheng","id":10466053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDY2MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10466053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng","html_url":"https://github.com/wangshucheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangshucheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117552/timeline","performed_via_github_app":